    "A notification says which device and session needs you, and nothing else. No prompt text, output or file contents leave the gateway.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A notification says which device and session needs you, and nothing else. No prompt text, output or file contents leave the gateway."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通知只说明哪台设备的哪个会话需要你，不包含其他内容。提示词、输出和文件内容都不会离开网关。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A worktree gives the agent its own checkout, so your working copy stays untouched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A worktree gives the agent its own checkout, so your working copy stays untouched."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "worktree 给 agent 一份独立的检出，你的工作副本不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
